<% --[[ What a navigation inside the workspace gets back: the tool that changed, and the two pieces of
        this shell that depend on which tool it is.

        Both already carry `hx-swap-oob` when they are built, because whoever builds them is told
        whether the document is on screen. Rendering them here a second way would be two spellings of
        the same markup, and the one that rots is the one on the path nobody reloads. ]] %>
<title><%= title %></title>

<div id="view"><%- body %></div>

<%- chrome.rail %>
<%- chrome.target %>
<div id="toasts" aria-live="polite" hx-swap-oob="true"><%- toasts or "" %></div>
